WEBVTT

00:00:01.000 --> 00:00:01.830
Ah!

00:00:01.830 --> 00:00:02.940
What should I do?!

00:00:02.940 --> 00:00:05.810
This is the biggest pinch 
Spring Onion Ramen's been in!

00:00:05.810 --> 00:00:08.070
We were trying to figure out if Mitsuki should go to the audition...

00:00:08.070 --> 00:00:10.650
...and we ended up getting into a huge fight!

00:00:10.650 --> 00:00:11.280
Because...

00:00:11.280 --> 00:00:12.280
...if we had just let her go...

00:00:12.280 --> 00:00:15.660
...the handbook said that something would threaten her life!

00:00:15.660 --> 00:00:16.870
Besides...

00:00:16.870 --> 00:00:19.230
...it seems like Takuto's feelings are...

00:00:20.340 --> 00:00:21.070
Well, then...

00:00:21.070 --> 00:00:22.870
...I wonder what's going to happen today.

00:00:22.900 --> 00:00:23.450
Huh?

00:00:27.640 --> 00:00:28.820
Do you understand?

00:00:29.100 --> 00:00:29.670
Yes.

00:02:12.350 --> 00:02:13.680
I won't let you go.

00:02:13.870 --> 00:02:15.870
What are you fooling around for?!

00:02:16.650 --> 00:02:17.650
Look at this.

00:02:17.950 --> 00:02:19.130
Audition?

00:02:20.110 --> 00:02:20.780
That's right.

00:02:20.780 --> 00:02:21.690
That's why...

00:02:21.690 --> 00:02:23.110
...you can't transform her...

00:02:23.110 --> 00:02:25.760
You can't help her go to the audition!

00:02:28.200 --> 00:02:29.580
I didn't want to say this, but...

00:02:29.580 --> 00:02:31.180
You and that girl...

00:02:32.120 --> 00:02:33.650
...are somehow seem to be related.

00:02:35.590 --> 00:02:37.120
If you get any closer to her...

00:02:37.120 --> 00:02:39.630
...it'll bring back your memories from when you were a human.

00:02:39.630 --> 00:02:42.650
You know what will happen then, right?!

00:02:47.430 --> 00:02:48.590
I love you...

00:02:50.640 --> 00:02:54.040
I want to be with you forever...

00:02:55.650 --> 00:02:59.960
I don't want you to become a ghost, Takuto...

00:03:33.680 --> 00:03:35.150
The whistle's missing...

00:03:35.150 --> 00:03:36.470
What should I do?

00:03:36.470 --> 00:03:39.100
I can't call for Takuto without it...

00:03:41.320 --> 00:03:42.290
Takuto...

00:03:49.580 --> 00:03:54.140
I don't want you to become a ghost, Takuto...

00:03:57.670 --> 00:03:58.600
Mitsuki-san!

00:04:02.800 --> 00:04:04.030
Did something happen?

00:04:04.510 --> 00:04:05.500
Takuto!

00:04:07.550 --> 00:04:08.660
Madam...

00:04:08.660 --> 00:04:10.570
It doesn't look like she's in the house.

00:04:11.350 --> 00:04:12.660
Madam!

00:04:15.020 --> 00:04:16.550
I'm fine...

00:04:16.550 --> 00:04:18.430
I was feeling a little dizzy...

00:04:18.700 --> 00:04:20.200
For heaven's sake...

00:04:20.200 --> 00:04:22.920
How much more is she going to make me worry?

00:04:23.820 --> 00:04:26.400
Running away from the hospital in her state...

00:04:26.400 --> 00:04:27.660
Hospital?!

00:04:26.400 --> 00:04:27.150
Madam.

00:04:27.150 --> 00:04:28.320
Please rest.

00:04:27.660 --> 00:04:29.550
Did she collapse?!

00:04:28.320 --> 00:04:30.680
You have to watch your health.

00:04:31.790 --> 00:04:32.910
No!

00:04:32.910 --> 00:04:33.910
I won't let you go!

00:04:33.910 --> 00:04:36.080
I won't let you go... even if it kills me.

00:04:36.080 --> 00:04:37.370
I mean...

00:04:37.370 --> 00:04:40.040
I just gave you a serious confession...

00:04:46.840 --> 00:04:47.710
But...

00:04:49.300 --> 00:04:50.970
...it's the fifty-seventh time.

00:04:50.970 --> 00:04:51.530
Gah!

00:04:52.890 --> 00:04:54.180
No matter...

00:04:54.560 --> 00:04:57.320
No matter how many times I confess...

00:04:57.320 --> 00:05:01.350
...I'm always serious! {Seriously, now's not the time for your bs}

00:05:01.350 --> 00:05:04.290
Takuto, you insensitive jerk!

00:05:11.280 --> 00:05:12.620
Ow!

00:05:12.620 --> 00:05:14.280
It hurts!

00:05:14.770 --> 00:05:15.950
Are you okay?

00:05:21.250 --> 00:05:23.670
It hurts so much that I can't stand...

00:05:24.250 --> 00:05:27.470
Well, you're a tough person...

00:05:27.470 --> 00:05:29.000
You should be able to handle this.

00:05:29.000 --> 00:05:29.590
Hey!

00:05:29.590 --> 00:05:32.010
What do you mean, "I'm tough?!"

00:05:32.010 --> 00:05:33.910
So you are fine, after all.

00:05:39.600 --> 00:05:42.480
If you aren't going to listen to my advice...

00:05:42.480 --> 00:05:46.230
...I'll report everything that's happened to the Shinigami main office.

00:05:46.230 --> 00:05:48.090
You'll be punished.

00:05:49.530 --> 00:05:50.690
Do whatever you want.

00:05:50.690 --> 00:05:51.900
Takuto!

00:05:51.900 --> 00:05:54.280
No matter what the handbook tells you...

00:05:54.280 --> 00:05:56.450
No matter what the Shinigami main office will do to me...

00:05:56.450 --> 00:05:58.370
...I have to go.

00:05:58.370 --> 00:05:59.660
Why?

00:05:59.660 --> 00:06:02.250
Why do you go that far for her?! {edited}

00:06:03.250 --> 00:06:04.850
I don't even know that myself.

00:06:05.670 --> 00:06:06.610
But...

00:06:06.610 --> 00:06:08.690
...I can't just leave her alone!

00:06:11.340 --> 00:06:13.060
If she can't sing...

00:06:13.060 --> 00:06:15.880
...I get this feeling that she'd die from that alone!

00:06:15.880 --> 00:06:20.200
{shani: Takuto is a super shinigami. that take off was fantastic. almost like keanu reeves}

00:06:20.850 --> 00:06:22.210
You're terrible... so terrible... Takuto. {Alpha-time}

00:06:22.210 --> 00:06:23.480
You're terrible... so terrible... Takuto. {Alpha-time}

00:06:23.480 --> 00:06:24.250
You're terrible... so terrible... Takuto. {Alpha-time}

00:06:24.650 --> 00:06:25.980
In that case...

00:06:25.980 --> 00:06:29.600
...I'll do whatever it takes to make her miss the audition!

00:06:29.600 --> 00:06:32.360
I'm going to get in the way! {That line, lol}

00:06:38.290 --> 00:06:40.410
Really... where'd she go off to?

00:06:40.410 --> 00:06:41.720
With her health...

00:06:49.300 --> 00:06:50.150
A whistle?

00:06:55.890 --> 00:06:57.110
Dr. Wakaouji.

00:06:57.640 --> 00:06:59.050
Did someone from her home call?

00:06:59.050 --> 00:07:01.440
The housekeeper, Tanaka-san, did just a moment ago...

00:07:01.440 --> 00:07:02.260
And?

00:07:02.260 --> 00:07:04.910
She hasn't gone home yet.

00:07:06.060 --> 00:07:07.180
That girl...

00:07:07.180 --> 00:07:09.790
She lost the whistle?

00:07:13.110 --> 00:07:14.000
Yeah.

00:07:14.000 --> 00:07:15.320
I might have an idea.

00:07:15.320 --> 00:07:16.880
I'm going to look right now.

00:07:17.570 --> 00:07:19.890
Please let me know if something happens.

00:07:25.830 --> 00:07:28.540
Today's a sunny day, just like yesterday.

00:07:28.540 --> 00:07:31.130
It looks like it'll be this summer's hottest day yet.

00:07:31.540 --> 00:07:33.090
Well, next up is the traffic report.

00:07:33.550 --> 00:07:36.210
Let's ask Kawada-san from the traffic center.

00:07:36.210 --> 00:07:37.370
Kawada-san?

00:07:37.370 --> 00:07:38.550
Yes!

00:08:45.790 --> 00:08:46.940
Eichi-kun...

00:08:46.940 --> 00:08:48.870
I won't cry.

00:09:18.410 --> 00:09:19.800
She didn't get on, huh?

00:09:34.170 --> 00:09:37.130
{No TS?}

00:09:42.140 --> 00:09:43.680
Good morning!

00:09:43.680 --> 00:09:44.530
Ah.

00:09:44.530 --> 00:09:45.800
Good morning, Madoka-chan.

00:09:46.430 --> 00:09:48.640
Thank you so much for yesterday.

00:09:48.640 --> 00:09:50.910
I had such a great time!

00:09:52.860 --> 00:09:53.850
I did too.

00:09:54.360 --> 00:09:56.710
You looked good yesterday, Madoka-chan.

00:09:58.070 --> 00:09:59.680
I'm going to do my best today!

00:09:59.680 --> 00:10:01.460
I'm looking forward to this!

00:10:02.530 --> 00:10:03.170
Well.

00:10:03.620 --> 00:10:05.070
Shall we start the camera test?

00:10:05.070 --> 00:10:05.860
Okay!

00:10:08.870 --> 00:10:10.380
Please...

00:10:08.960 --> 00:10:10.080
Then... Madoka-san... {split}

00:10:10.080 --> 00:10:11.470
This way please.

00:10:10.370 --> 00:10:12.000
Answer the phone, Mitsuki.

00:10:46.200 --> 00:10:47.080
Oh no.

00:10:47.080 --> 00:10:48.660
What's wrong with this girl?

00:10:48.660 --> 00:10:50.410
It's probably for a TV show.

00:10:50.410 --> 00:10:51.910
They do this all the time lately.

00:10:51.910 --> 00:10:53.370
All those variety shows...

00:11:25.160 --> 00:11:26.460
Besides...

00:11:26.460 --> 00:11:27.590
I...

00:11:28.330 --> 00:11:30.050
...still haven't apologized.

00:12:27.710 --> 00:12:30.010
Mitsuki!!!

00:12:35.690 --> 00:12:36.610
Mitsuki!

00:12:36.610 --> 00:12:37.470
Hold on!

00:12:37.470 --> 00:12:38.430
Mitsuki!

00:12:42.070 --> 00:12:43.250
She isn't breathing.

00:13:10.100 --> 00:13:11.130
Mitsuki!

00:13:14.180 --> 00:13:15.740
Eichi-kun? {Baka}

00:13:36.830 --> 00:13:38.470
What are you doing?!

00:13:39.170 --> 00:13:40.580
Hey! Hey! Hey!

00:13:40.580 --> 00:13:43.210
What are you doing... falling asleep in a place like this?!

00:13:43.210 --> 00:13:44.920
Ah... um...

00:13:45.630 --> 00:13:46.480
This way!

00:13:46.920 --> 00:13:48.800
Ah... hey! You! Hold it!

00:13:48.880 --> 00:13:49.650
Wait!

00:14:14.990 --> 00:14:15.910
Um...

00:14:16.160 --> 00:14:17.830
Does it still hurt?

00:14:17.830 --> 00:14:18.530
Eh?

00:14:18.530 --> 00:14:22.070
Ah... no... it doesn't hurt anywhere now.

00:14:22.070 --> 00:14:22.850
Okay.

00:14:23.380 --> 00:14:24.860
When does the audition start?

00:14:24.860 --> 00:14:26.060
Um...

00:14:27.380 --> 00:14:29.090
It's already 11 o'clock?!

00:14:29.090 --> 00:14:30.300
What should I do?!

00:14:30.300 --> 00:14:32.570
The audition's already started!

00:14:33.720 --> 00:14:34.470
No way!

00:14:34.500 --> 00:14:35.050
Hurry up.

00:14:35.050 --> 00:14:35.840
We can still make it.

00:14:36.000 --> 00:14:36.680
Huh?

00:14:37.560 --> 00:14:39.400
You want Eichi to notice you, right?

00:14:39.400 --> 00:14:41.010
You can't give up, then!

00:14:42.940 --> 00:14:43.750
Okay!

00:14:49.490 --> 00:14:51.650
You think I'll let you get there on time?

00:14:52.610 --> 00:14:53.840
Absolutely not...!

00:15:05.000 --> 00:15:06.350
Ah!

00:15:08.500 --> 00:15:09.420
Ah? {Oh no}

00:15:09.840 --> 00:15:10.820
What's wrong?! {Here it comes}

00:15:13.840 --> 00:15:15.100
Kya!

00:15:15.100 --> 00:15:16.860
Don't look! {Poor Mitsuki}

00:15:18.140 --> 00:15:20.550
H-Hurry up and get away from there.

00:15:20.550 --> 00:15:23.010
My shoe's stuck... I can't get away!

00:15:23.010 --> 00:15:23.770
Then...

00:15:23.770 --> 00:15:24.870
Don't look!

00:15:26.230 --> 00:15:28.460
Sorry, did that hurt?

00:15:30.360 --> 00:15:31.980
Geez... Takuto...

00:15:39.410 --> 00:15:40.670
Does it hurt?

00:15:41.410 --> 00:15:42.410
I'm fine.

00:15:42.410 --> 00:15:43.100
All right.

00:15:43.460 --> 00:15:44.490
We're almost there.

00:15:44.490 --> 00:15:45.220
Okay.

00:15:45.870 --> 00:15:47.940
I'm just getting started... {edited}

00:15:53.250 --> 00:15:54.360
Mitsuki!

00:15:55.760 --> 00:15:56.920
Are you okay?

00:15:58.720 --> 00:15:59.970
Just look at her face...

00:16:00.350 --> 00:16:00.830
Huh?

00:16:02.890 --> 00:16:03.850
Meroko!

00:16:03.850 --> 00:16:06.560
Why am I seeing stars all around? {edited}

00:16:06.560 --> 00:16:07.610
Are you okay?

00:16:07.610 --> 00:16:09.250
Yeah... somehow...

00:16:10.480 --> 00:16:11.060
Ah..?

00:16:11.150 --> 00:16:12.020
Ah?!

00:16:12.020 --> 00:16:13.460
No way! {Abunai ja nai ka?! Meroko no Baka!}

00:16:14.480 --> 00:16:15.650
Mitsuki!

00:16:21.450 --> 00:16:22.240
Eh?

00:16:25.040 --> 00:16:26.130
Takuto...

00:16:26.130 --> 00:16:28.200
Ah... that was close...

00:16:32.260 --> 00:16:33.630
O-Oh crap.

00:16:33.630 --> 00:16:35.590
I wonder if this is for TV too?

00:16:35.590 --> 00:16:38.590
They do a lot of filming these days, huh...

00:16:45.560 --> 00:16:46.800
Too easy.

00:16:54.970 --> 00:16:55.650
Ah!

00:16:55.650 --> 00:16:56.860
It's <i>Full Moon</i> !

00:16:56.860 --> 00:16:58.900
<i>Full Moon's</i>  right here!

00:16:59.280 --> 00:16:59.780
What?!

00:16:59.780 --> 00:17:00.820
<i>Full Moon</i> ?!

00:17:00.820 --> 00:17:01.990
Really? The real thing?!

00:17:01.990 --> 00:17:03.080
<i>Full Moon </i>?

00:17:03.080 --> 00:17:04.740
Then the filming just now...

00:17:05.250 --> 00:17:06.330
There she is!

00:17:06.330 --> 00:17:07.970
W-What do I do?!

00:17:08.330 --> 00:17:09.350
Let's run!

00:17:14.050 --> 00:17:15.060
This way!

00:17:20.930 --> 00:17:22.590
An idol couldn't possibly be here... {idol diving, it's the latest craze}

00:17:22.590 --> 00:17:24.530
We should still make sure.

00:17:32.020 --> 00:17:33.670
Somehow... we managed to lose them...

00:17:35.280 --> 00:17:35.990
There!

00:17:35.990 --> 00:17:36.610
Huh?

00:17:36.610 --> 00:17:38.690
The studio is in that building!

00:17:38.690 --> 00:17:39.150
Okay!

00:17:39.150 --> 00:17:39.990
Let's hurry!

00:17:46.080 --> 00:17:47.210
Over there!

00:17:47.210 --> 00:17:48.450
She's going in the building!

00:17:48.710 --> 00:17:50.410
Crap... they found us!

00:18:06.020 --> 00:18:06.970
What a relief...

00:18:14.070 --> 00:18:16.580
Ah... s-sorry...

00:18:17.110 --> 00:18:19.940
But... that was...

00:18:35.590 --> 00:18:37.880
I-I'm sorry about that.

00:18:37.880 --> 00:18:38.560
Eh?

00:18:39.340 --> 00:18:41.470
Sorry that it wasn't from someone else.

00:18:41.470 --> 00:18:45.170
It's your fault for collapsing in the first place... that's why I had to use mouth-to-mouth...

00:18:45.170 --> 00:18:46.010
No way!

00:18:46.010 --> 00:18:47.590
You don't have to put it like that...

00:18:55.980 --> 00:18:57.840
Well... don't worry about it.

00:18:57.840 --> 00:18:59.530
It was only just mouth-to-mouth...

00:18:59.530 --> 00:19:03.530
That... wasn't... a kiss...

00:19:03.530 --> 00:19:06.220
It doesn't count as a first kiss.

00:19:10.910 --> 00:19:11.960
It stopped...?

00:19:11.960 --> 00:19:12.990
Why now?

00:19:12.990 --> 00:19:14.810
We were almost there.

00:19:23.090 --> 00:19:26.780
There's no way a Half-Shinigami can beat me.

00:19:34.900 --> 00:19:35.960
Sorry...

00:19:38.150 --> 00:19:41.050
I asked you something you didn't want to hear...

00:19:41.050 --> 00:19:42.710
Don't worry about it.

00:19:43.070 --> 00:19:44.720
Anyways... don't give up.

00:19:44.720 --> 00:19:48.320
Didn't you decide that you were going to do your best until Eichi noticed you?

00:19:48.320 --> 00:19:48.990
Yeah...

00:19:49.950 --> 00:19:52.640
But... I won't make it there in time now...

00:19:57.210 --> 00:19:58.710
I'll get you there in time.

00:19:58.710 --> 00:19:59.350
Eh?

00:20:00.370 --> 00:20:01.710
Meroko!

00:20:01.710 --> 00:20:04.260
If you want to rat me out to the 
Shinigami main office, go ahead!

00:20:04.260 --> 00:20:07.360
I'm going to help her, no matter what happens!

00:20:07.760 --> 00:20:09.070
You got that?!

00:20:09.070 --> 00:20:10.360
Takuto...

00:20:13.940 --> 00:20:14.680
Let's go.

00:20:15.810 --> 00:20:16.700
Okay!

00:20:28.030 --> 00:20:29.170
So pretty...

00:20:52.930 --> 00:20:55.480
You can go the rest of the way by yourself, right?

00:20:55.480 --> 00:20:56.280
Yeah.

00:20:56.280 --> 00:20:56.940
All right!

00:20:56.940 --> 00:20:57.810
Go for it.

00:20:57.810 --> 00:20:58.580
Okay!

00:21:00.110 --> 00:21:01.520
Thank you for waiting.

00:21:01.520 --> 00:21:04.590
We will be announcing our decision now.

00:21:05.490 --> 00:21:07.820
The image character for Mermaid Tear is...

00:21:08.120 --> 00:21:10.990
...Wakamatsu Madoka-kun.

00:21:12.820 --> 00:21:14.220
No way...

00:23:05.520 --> 00:23:06.480
That girl...

00:23:06.480 --> 00:23:08.690
She didn't make it in time for the audition...

00:23:08.690 --> 00:23:11.820
That means that I accomplished my mission, right?

00:23:11.820 --> 00:23:12.320
No.

00:23:12.320 --> 00:23:13.400
Not at all!

00:23:13.400 --> 00:23:14.820
What do you mean?

00:23:14.820 --> 00:23:16.160
Isn't everything okay now?

00:23:16.160 --> 00:23:19.240
You don't have to go around 
protecting that girl anymore.

00:23:19.240 --> 00:23:20.550
No! Not yet!

00:23:20.910 --> 00:23:23.770
I'm not going to just let her run away!

00:23:23.770 --> 00:23:28.210
I won't let her give up on singing that easily!

00:23:28.210 --> 00:23:30.720
Next time on Full Moon wo Sagashite:

00:23:30.720 --> 00:23:32.470
The Voice of Song that Can't Reach Him
